{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:47 2026-09-15 HKT</p>\n\n<p>大嶼山芝麻灣道333號對開山路，今日（9月15日）下午2時許，有一男一女於私家車上被發現昏迷，警方消防接報趕至，當場證實兩人已經死亡。</p>\n<p>據了解，死者均為40多歲，分別為男司機及女乘客，警方在車內發現一包炭及金屬盆，惟未見遺書。目前兩人確實死因仍待調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"警員在車內尋獲一包炭。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/004b1ac8dad6c8a550025784d11deb73/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-15_at_18_42_34.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a73bc46c5bda62f1b2af3af67c1b99b5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-15_at_18_42_35.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a027bd71a7928879198d392e0dfdaba/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-15_at_18_42_35_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為大嶼山芝麻灣道333號對開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e38b6f01bfff0c938942467a81001a49/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-15_at_18_42_49.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為大嶼山芝麻灣道333號對開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb0248b605b86865248dd857d7f718b6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-15_at_18_42_36.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T10:59:52.713310+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}